        instruction = "Speak with Tohopka, who is standing right next to Sigismund, at (E-7). Tohopka tells you how to collect the tears. You'll need to obtain some Pugil Scales. Pugils drop them, or you can find them under the AH category Bonecrafting. If there are no Scales on the AH, you can kill Pugils just outside in East Sarutabaruta for some.",
