      {
        order = 4,
        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "With some Scales in your possession, head out to West Sarutabaruta. On the map, there is a place called the \"Starfall Hillock.\" In the general vicinity of that area, at (I-6), you will find the Twinkle Tree. If you're having trouble finding the tree, it's a somewhat rounded tree that has a blue firefly-type glow during the nighttime.",
