        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "Only expansive outdoor areas count as Field areas, places like Dangruf Wadi, Davoi, & Ifrit's Cauldron that feel a bit outdoorsy all count as dungeons. As a general rule of thumb, if you can't use a mount there, it won't count.",
