        depth = 1,
        instruction = "You can see reminder as to which zones are \"Original Areas\" or \"Zilart\" by looking for region-related quests in your Records of Eminence quest log, or by setting your Home Point & Survival Guide lists to \"Select by expansion\" instead of \"Select by region\".",
